              '[Loctite PL Roof & Flashing Polyurethane Sealant technical data sheet, rev. Oct. 30, 2024](https://www.buildsite.com/pdf/pl/Loctite-PL-S30-Polyurethane-Roof-Flashing-Sealant-Product-Data-2973866.pdf)',
